538130/extras/9eed29dd61b37f623eb08893b4122fdd.mp4?t=1753289093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d\u00a0<strong>Complete quests to uncover the night\u2019s mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is clear (well, kind of): <strong>figure out the chaos</strong>. But to do that, you\u2019ll need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Tofu\u2019s personality \u2014 are you full chill or full chaos? You decide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each venue with its own unique vibe and look for clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate some very questionable witnesses and fulfill their weird requests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, go totally wild and consume <strong>LOTS OF SUGAR</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/d6bbbba2cd6279b33f9a7198cef333fb.poster.avif?t=1753289093\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/d6bbbba2cd6279b33f9a7198cef333fb.webm?t=1753289093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/d6bbbba2cd6279b33f9a7198cef333fb.mp4?t=1753289093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf81\u00a0<strong>Find all the collectibles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig deep to unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited-edition, one-of-a-kind candies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories, hidden references, and memes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret achievements that reward your curiosity and love for the absurd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/69e52dfd2aae2d6c5460eb02d7ed0aab.poster.avif?t=1753289093\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/69e52dfd2aae2d6c5460eb02d7ed0aab.webm?t=1753289093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/69e52dfd2aae2d6c5460eb02d7ed0aab.mp4?t=1753289093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae\u00a0<strong>Conquer every minigame</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A college night without doing something stupid? Not on our watch!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games to test your reflexes and rhythm, show off your dance floor skills, or flex your musical talent...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some minigames will change Tofu\u2019s status (yep, tipsy mode included!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay them as many times as you want to beat your personal best.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet me in Furrol?</strong><br>11 PM at the plaza \u2014 <strong>don\u2019t be late!</strong> \ud83c\udf6d\u2728</p>",
